    "summary": "For a **HERETIC ASTARTES NURGLE** model. As the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, roll one D6 for each enemy unit 3″ or closer to the bearer; on a 4+, that unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).\n\nAdd 1 to these rolls if the unit containing the bearer used a [Dark Pact](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.dark-pacts) this phase without failing its [Leadership test](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls).",
